WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.880
- But how did you come up
with the idea? The rapping?

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.090
How did you think that would sway them

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:05.320
and get better grades?

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.780
- So I've been teaching for
six years and it's always

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:10.920
a challenge every beginning
of the year and how to

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.770
engage and motivate the children.

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:13.603
- [Kelly] Mmhmm.

00:00:13.603 --> 00:00:17.210
- So, this year I wanted to
incorporate free styling into it

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:21.194
because every single time I'd
give all my students free time

00:00:21.194 --> 00:00:23.820
they'd go onto the computer
and look up beats and they'd

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:26.090
just go off and rap.

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:27.179
- That's so amazing.

00:00:27.179 --> 00:00:29.168
(audience claps)

00:00:29.168 --> 00:00:30.060
(laughs)

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.701
- I love that!

00:00:31.701 --> 00:00:35.250
So Taj, you look very
handsome head to toe as well.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.300
You look sharp right now.
Just letting you know.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.030
But what do you think
about free style Fridays?

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:40.863
Do you like that?

00:00:40.863 --> 00:00:41.780
- Yes.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:42.613
- [Kelly] Yeah?

00:00:42.613 --> 00:00:47.540
- What I think about free style Friday is

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.900
that you get

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:54.621
to learn but you get to
play at the same time.

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:56.380
- [Kelly] Yeah, you get to have fun too.

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:58.010
And school should be fun.

00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:00.060
It should be educational, it
should also be a good time

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.500
and implement both of
those things together.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.330
You've a really great teacher right here

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.770
just letting you know.

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:07.011
Do you like rapping?
What do you rap about?

00:01:07.011 --> 00:01:09.347
- Money (mumbles)

00:01:09.347 --> 00:01:11.697
(clapping)
(audience laughs)

00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:13.170
and...

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:14.697
- You said money, what?

00:01:14.697 --> 00:01:15.845
- And beats and cars.

00:01:15.845 --> 00:01:20.050
- And beats and cars and
school, all right. All right.

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:21.402
- Yes they do.

00:01:21.402 --> 00:01:24.900
- I like it you know what you
want, you know what you like.

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:26.130
I'm a fan of it Taj.

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:29.390
So can any of y'all freestyle?
I can not rap for anything

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:31.270
everybody saw it on Billboard Awards.

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:32.650
- Can you freestyle?

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:34.599
- No, that's my greatest fear in life.

00:01:34.599 --> 00:01:35.432
(audience laughs)

00:01:35.432 --> 00:01:37.471
- Yeah, I most definitely cannot.

00:01:37.471 --> 00:01:38.304
- Bronc?

00:01:38.304 --> 00:01:39.137
- [Woman] It's the free style that scares-

00:01:39.137 --> 00:01:40.591
- My boy Bronc can do it though right?

00:01:40.591 --> 00:01:41.459
- [Kelly] Can you rap?

00:01:41.459 --> 00:01:42.292
- Hey-

00:01:42.292 --> 00:01:43.125
- He can do it!

00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:45.343
- Back in college at 2:00
AM, I was always rapping.

00:01:45.343 --> 00:01:46.356
(laughs)

00:01:46.356 --> 00:01:49.081
- Well at 2:00 AM, we all think
we are great at everything.

00:01:49.081 --> 00:01:49.914
(laughs)

00:01:49.914 --> 00:01:51.030
- One time my friend recorded me

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:53.188
and I was like, "Wow, I'm awful."

00:01:53.188 --> 00:01:54.356
(audience laughs)

00:01:54.356 --> 00:01:56.538
I thought I was like amazing
at that time, at that moment.

00:01:56.538 --> 00:01:57.796
(laughs)

00:01:57.796 --> 00:01:59.949
- I love you! Oh my God!

00:01:59.949 --> 00:02:01.740
- I can hit a line, I can hit a line...

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:02.825
- Okay, do it.

00:02:02.825 --> 00:02:05.266
♪ You think I'm a rapper.
I'm only a snapper. ♪

00:02:05.266 --> 00:02:06.813
♪ I get in a fight, hit you in the face ♪

00:02:06.813 --> 00:02:08.601
♪ make you a two gapper ♪

00:02:08.601 --> 00:02:11.434
(audience cheers)

00:02:13.803 --> 00:02:15.303
- Did you just make that up?

00:02:15.303 --> 00:02:16.396
- Yah I just made it up.

00:02:16.396 --> 00:02:18.498
- You just free styled that?

00:02:18.498 --> 00:02:19.331
(laughs)

00:02:19.331 --> 00:02:20.690
(audience claps)

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:21.710
- Okay, but we just want let Taj know

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:23.574
that hitting is not acceptable.

00:02:23.574 --> 00:02:24.407
- No.

00:02:24.407 --> 00:02:26.907
(laughs)
(claps)

00:02:26.907 --> 00:02:28.156
- [Bronc] That was a bad message.

00:02:28.156 --> 00:02:28.989
- [Kelly] No I'm just kidding.

00:02:28.989 --> 00:02:30.680
Literally that's like my husband and I

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:32.490
we're like, "wait we said
that in front of them.

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:34.850
Okay, let's go back to we just said..."

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:35.840
(laughs)

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.440
cause they listen to everything.

